precision.\n\ntry it now in Krea Video. https://t.co/nNKEIaZTJZ", "url": "https://x.com/krea_ai/status/2122755814041735473"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122751855898001408"]}, "author_id": "1478679005788311552", "conversation_id": "2122751891256058043", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:01:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122751891256058043"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Scribe v3 Live Medical helps agents catch drug names and clinical terms on live calls, with the lowest WER of the medical models we tested.", "display_url": "elevenlabs.io/blog/scribe-v3…", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://elevenlabs.io/blog/scribe-v3-live-medical", "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Scribe v3 Live Medical: transcription for healthcare agents", "unwound_url": "https://elevenlabs.io/blog/scribe-v3-live-medical", "url": "https://t.co/7M7UF6XCK0"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/dLT7o2UrUn", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ElevenLabs/status/2122751891256058043/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2122751855898001408", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/dLT7o2UrUn"}]}, "id": "2122751891256058043", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 51361, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 50, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 29}, "text": "Scribe v3 Live Medical brings medical transcription to live calls.\n\nIt helps voice agents get medications, procedures, and symptoms right, and teams can add up to 10,000 of their own terms, like provider and drug names.\n\nNow in ElevenAgents.\n\nhttps://t.co/7M7UF6XCK0 https://t.co/dLT7o2UrUn", "url": "https://x.com/ElevenLabs/status/2122751891256058043"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122746394209390592"]}, "author_id": "1592049847087112193", "conversation_id": "2122746557090967912", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:39:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122746557090967912"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wqc1x5AEoZ", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/recraftai/status/2122746557090967912/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122746394209390592", "start": 179, "url": "https://t.co/wqc1x5AEoZ"}]}, "id": "2122746557090967912", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 564, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This week's palette: #000000.\n\nBlack Friday: 40% off any yearly plan.\n\nRecraft, Nano Banana, GPT Image, and more, from $6/month. No code needed.\n\nBilled annually. New plans only. https://t.co/wqc1x5AEoZ", "url": "https://x.com/recraftai/status/2122746557090967912"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2122744191604146176"]}, "author_id": "39622874", "conversation_id": "2122744226500780110", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:30:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122744226500780110"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/AvNI5L49cC", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fal/status/2122744226500780110/video/1", "media_key": "7_2122744191604146176", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/AvNI5L49cC"}]}, "id": "2122744226500780110", "lang": "en", "note_tweet": {"text": "HeyGen's Avatar 6 is now available on fal.\n\nThree ways to make a character speak, each with a Turbo variant.\n\nImage to Video: animates one photo with an audio track and a motion prompt\nReference Video to Video: brings an animated or illustrated character to life from a reference clip\nIdentity to Video: generates a video from a HeyGen avatar, a voice and a script"}, "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 59, "impression_count": 6507, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "HeyGen's Avatar 6 is now available on fal.\n\nThree ways to make a character speak, each with a Turbo variant.\n\nImage to Video: animates one photo with an audio track and a motion prompt\nReference Video to Video: brings an animated or illustrated character to life from a reference https://t.co/AvNI5L49cC", "url": "https://x.com/fal/status/2122744226500780110"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122742962287456256"]}, "author_id": "1662884034056257542", "conversation_id": "2122743043635941502", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:25:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122743043635941502"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "ideogram.ai/features/print…", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://ideogram.ai/features/print-on-demand-studio", "start": 246, "url": "https://t.co/WF6TrcbLmP"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/Thh4Ui7Kdv", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ideogram_ai/status/2122743043635941502/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122742962287456256", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/Thh4Ui7Kdv"}]}, "id": "2122743043635941502", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 3920, "like_count": 85, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 16, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "Many of our users love Ideogram for print: the unique typography, hand-crafted designs, and our new Vector model. So we built a dedicated studio.\n\nIntroducing Ideogram Print on Demand Studio: research, design, print prep, and mockups.\n\nLive now: https://t.co/WF6TrcbLmP https://t.co/Thh4Ui7Kdv", "url": "https://x.com/ideogram_ai/status/2122743043635941502"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122732859442233348"]}, "author_id": "1550049838019907584", "conversation_id": "2122738284405117217", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:07:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122738284405117217"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/VyWis5XBs3", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HeyGen/status/2122738284405117217/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122732859442233348", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/VyWis5XBs3"}]}, "id": "2122738284405117217", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1125, "impression_count": 675373, "like_count": 1760, "quote_count": 272, "reply_count": 1158, "retweet_count": 768}, "text": "can you tell which one is real?\n\n84% couldn't\n\nintroducing Avatar 6, #1 on New Measure's Avatar Arena\n\nwhat's new:\n\nrealism - passes for the real you\n\ncontext-aware gestures - matches what your script means\n\nreference - up to 30 secs of video + a photo\n\ntry it now ↓ https://t.co/VyWis5XBs3", "url": "https://x.com/HeyGen/status/2122738284405117217"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122736722761097216"]}, "author_id": "1307056292465274880", "conversation_id": "2122738136342282735", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:06:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122738136342282735"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YmXIhnZHrz", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/midjourney/status/2122738136342282735/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122736722761097216", "start": 260, "url": "https://t.co/YmXIhnZHrz"}]}, "id": "2122738136342282735", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 113, "impression_count": 17154, "like_count": 351, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 34}, "text": "We've added support for Moodboards, Style Codes, and Style References to our edit model. Just drop an image in your prompt bar under \"attach to prompt\" then add your favorite moodboard, style codes, or sref images and push enter (no prompts needed). Have fun! https://t.co/YmXIhnZHrz", "url": "https://x.com/midjourney/status/2122738136342282735"}, {"author_id": "1519705236713189377", "conversation_id": "2122732056715350016", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:42:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122732056715350016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/brunoahualli/s…", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/brunoahualli/status/2122729368338464948", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/Y6sK340sPy"}]}, "id": "2122732056715350016", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 5299, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122729368338464948", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Great question! Visuals is included in the MCP 🎥\n\nWe can't wait to see what you create! https://t.co/Y6sK340sPy", "url": "https://x.com/suno/status/2122732056715350016"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122717019640311808"]}, "author_id": "1519705236713189377", "conversation_id": "2122717327464747307", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:43:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122717327464747307"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3pgi9AkBlN", "end": 217, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/suno/status/2122717327464747307/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122717019640311808", "start": 194, "url": "https://t.co/3pgi9AkBlN"}]}, "id": "2122717327464747307", "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 130, "impression_count": 40078, "like_count": 399, "quote_count": 55, "reply_count": 82, "retweet_count": 71}, "text": "Introducing Suno Visuals 🎥\n\nSet your music in motion: make a clip, a lyric video or a world built around your sound. \n\nFor all paid subscribers: try your first Visual, on us. Limited time only. https://t.co/3pgi9AkBlN", "url": "https://x.com/suno/status/2122717327464747307"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2122712176439738368"]}, "author_id": "39622874", "conversation_id": "2122712197163876760", "created_at": "2026-11-17T15:23:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122712197163876760"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/04arioytvL", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fal/status/2122712197163876760/video/1", "media_key": "7_2122712176439738368", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/04arioytvL"}]}, "id": "2122712197163876760", "lang": "en", "note_tweet": {"text": "Kling 4.0 Image is now live on fal.\n\nA new level of realism, precision, and creative control in AI image generation.\n\nThree major upgrades:\n- Photorealistic lighting, lifelike textures, and nati